data: {"id": "41c709fa65a748a8-final", "run_id": "41c709fa65a748a8", "seq": 818, "ts_ms": 1789115321629, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v03/workload` | Pending | Pod 定义中引用了不存在的 PersistentVolumeClaim (PVC) 'unavailable-claim'，导致 Kubernetes 调度器因无法绑定存储卷而持续将 Pod 保持在 Pending 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedScheduling 25m default-scheduler 0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found.` | 直接表明调度失败的具体原因为找不到指定的 PVC，且持续发生。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `PodScheduled condition: status=False, reason=Unschedulable, message: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found.` | 证实 Pod 状态长期处于 `Unschedulable`，与事件记录的故障机制一致。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `Pod phase: Pending` | 确认 Pod 尚未被调度，物理资源未分配，解释了为何无法采集日志。 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container resource_limits: cpu=50m, memory=32Mi` | 作为上下文证据，排除因 CPU 或内存资源不足导致调度失败的可能性。 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase[phase=PendTime]=1` | 从指标侧佐证 Pod 当前处于 Pending 状态，未发现 Failed 状态的计数（`phase=Failed` 值为 0）。 |\n\n当前调度失败的根本原因由 K8s 事件明确指向：缺少 PVC `unavailable-claim`。由于 Pod 卡在调度阶段，`logging` 与 `tracing` 维度均因容器未启动而无法采集（`pod_ip` 为空），这与 Pod 长期处于 `Pending` 状态的事实一致，未产生额外阻碍。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n应用定义引用不存在的 PVC 'unavailable-claim' → Kubernetes 调度器无法绑定存储卷 → Pod 调度失败 (Unschedulable) → Pod 保持 Pending 状态，持续拒绝调度\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认的根因为：应用 Pod 定义中引用了一个在当前集群中不存在的 `PersistentVolumeClaim`（名为 `unavailable-claim`）。\n证据表明，Kubernetes 调度器（default-scheduler）因无法找到该 PVC，明确拒绝了 Pod 的调度请求（`FailedScheduling`），导致 Pod 无法分配节点，从而一直处于 `Pending` 状态。证据支持（事实 1、事实 2）充分证实了这一机制。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 54.4s\n├─ 问题定位: 17.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 29.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v03/workload: 29.4s (Evidence 24.4s, RCA 5.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v03/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 54.414, "metrics": {"run_id": "41c709fa65a748a8", "mttr": {"value": "54.4s", "seconds": 54.41849374771118, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 54418.49374771118, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 50298.05326461792, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 9824.24807548523, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3793.5094833374023}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17056.865215301514, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence":